---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Base title="Experience — Scott McQueen" description="Scott McQueen's work in enterprise reporting, analytics modeling, reconciliation automation, and portfolio BI." current="experience">
  <header class="page-lead wrap">
    <div class="lead-meta"><p class="eyebrow">Experience / 03</p><span class="mono">BI / automation / delivery</span></div>
    <h1>From business case to technical delivery.</h1>
    <p class="lead-text">I have led reporting and automation initiatives from business case through proof of concept and technical handoff. I bring business teams and IT together to test platform fit, resolve constraints, and make delivery decisions with evidence.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="editorial-section wrap" aria-labelledby="scope-heading">
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / Delivery scope</p>
      <div>
        <h2 id="scope-heading">What the work involves.</h2>
        <div class="scope-grid">
          <article><span class="mono">01</span><h3>Understand the problem</h3><p>Identify who is affected, what they envision, and what improves when the problem is solved.</p></article>
          <article><span class="mono">02</span><h3>Design and define</h3><p>Study the current process and data, then define the model, business rules, and checks together.</p></article>
          <article><span class="mono">03</span><h3>Develop</h3><p>Build and test the solution while coordinating decisions with business leaders, architects, IT, and reporting teams.</p></article>
          <article><span class="mono">04</span><h3>Deliver</h3><p>Validate the result with users, release it, and make ownership and support clear.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-section wrap" aria-labelledby="record-heading">
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">02 / Representative record</p>
      <div>
        <h2 id="record-heading">Selected work.</h2>
        <p class="record-intro">A view of delivery areas. A dated role history is available in my resume.</p>
        <div class="record-list">
          <article class="record-row"><span class="mono">Reporting</span><div><h3>Test the proposed platform against the actual workload.</h3><p>Led an SAP BusinessObjects-to-Power BI proof of concept; query plans, service stress tests, and dependency analysis supported a change in migration approach.</p></div><a class="action-link" href={`${base}/work/reporting-modernization/`}>View work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="record-row"><span class="mono">Program lead</span><div><h3>Build the case and organize the migration team.</h3><p>Secured VP sponsorship for a Freight SAS-to-Azure reporting initiative, inventoried 170 reports, and led a cross-team group through planning and early proofs of concept.</p></div><a class="action-link" href={`${base}/work/sas-to-azure-migration/`}>View work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="record-row"><span class="mono">Modeling</span><div><h3>Turn accounting data into a usable BI model.</h3><p>Designed fact and dimension structures for a revenue accounting proof of concept in Power BI.</p></div><a class="action-link" href={`${base}/work/enterprise-data-modeling/`}>View work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="record-row"><span class="mono">Automation</span><div><h3>Automate monthly 401(k) reconciliation.</h3><p>Aggregated contribution totals from 30 source files each month and reconciled them automatically with Azure Synapse, SQL, and Python.</p></div><a class="action-link" href={`${base}/work/reconciliation-automation/`}>View work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="record-row"><span class="mono">Portfolio BI</span><div><h3>Don't interpret project health. Calculate it.</h3><p>Used SharePoint intake, modeled project data, and Power BI measures to calculate portfolio status from recorded activity.</p></div><a class="action-link" href={`${base}/work/portfolio-governance-platform/`}>View work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="experience-close">
    <div class="wrap close-grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / Next conversation</p>
      <div><h2>Roles where I can contribute.</h2><p>I am interested in business intelligence, reporting, automation, and technical delivery lead or manager roles. I can share a resume and discuss the work behind these examples.</p><a class="action-link" href={`${base}/contact/`}>Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .editorial-grid h2{max-width:22ch;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,3.5vw,3.75rem);letter-spacing:-.055em}
  .scope-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);margin-top:1.75rem}
  .scope-grid article{min-height:11rem;padding:1rem 1.3rem 1.8rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
  .scope-grid article:nth-child(even){padding-left:1.3rem;border-left:1px solid var(--rule)}
  .scope-grid .mono{color:var(--signal)}.scope-grid h3{font-family:'Space Grotesk',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.1vw,2.2rem);letter-spacing:-.045em;margin-top:1.8rem}.scope-grid p{max-width:26rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:.65rem}
  .record-intro{max-width:42rem;font-size:1.13rem;margin:1rem 0 1.75rem}.record-row p{max-width:40rem;margin-top:.7rem;line-height:1.45}.record-row .action-link{white-space:nowrap}
  .experience-close{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper-light);padding-block:clamp(4rem,6vw,6rem)}.experience-close .eyebrow{color:#66d5d7}.close-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.25rem}
  .close-grid h2{font-family:'Space Grotesk',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,3.5vw,3.75rem);letter-spacing:-.055em;max-width:22ch}.close-grid p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:42rem;font-size:1.15rem;margin-top:1.1rem;color:#c4d4d9}.close-grid .action-link{margin-top:1.75rem;border-color:var(--paper-light)}.close-grid .action-link:hover{color:#66d5d7;border-color:#66d5d7}
  @media(max-width:760px){.record-row .action-link{white-space:normal}}
  @media(max-width:540px){.scope-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.scope-grid article:nth-child(even){padding-left:0;border-left:0}.scope-grid article{min-height:0;padding:1rem 0 1.5rem}.scope-grid h3{margin-top:1.4rem}.record-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.5rem}.record-row a{grid-column:auto}}
</style>
